cut -b3-
# Interpreter for 'vpn-switch openvpn enumerate'
# Display-only: the process table is read at generation time, the report
# comes out as comment lines (managed by this instance, by another
# instance, not by vpn-switch); cut -b3- strips the leading '# '.
# Nothing is executed, so no sudo is needed; on a system that hides other
# users' processes from ps, run the whole command as root.
